# Copy this file to .env.local for local development and fill in real values.
# NEVER commit .env.local — it is already git-ignored.
#
# In production (Vercel, etc.) set these as Environment Variables in the
# hosting dashboard instead of committing them.

# --- Site ---
# Public canonical origin, no trailing slash. Used for canonical URLs,
# sitemap.xml, robots.txt and Open Graph/Twitter metadata.
